27268      title 'Introductory Main-Effects ANOVA Example';
27269      data a;
27270      input y x1 $ x2 $;
27271      datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.A has 12 observations and 3 variables.

27284      ;
27285      * Fit a main-effects ANOVA model with 1, 0, -1 coding;
27286      proc transreg ss2;
27287      model identity(y) = class(x1 x2 / effects);
27288      output coefficients replace;
27289      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.DATA30 has 14 observations and 9 variables.
